Tool response:
Tool: approve_grant
Description: Records approval for a specific role.
If both CFO and Legal Advisor are approved, updates grant status to 'approved'.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "grant_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Grant Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "approver_role": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "CFO",
            "legal_advisor"
          ],
          "title": "Approver Role"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "grant_id",
        "approver_role"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: upload_grant_document
Description: Records receipt of a document.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "grant_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Grant Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "document_type": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "signed_grant_agreement",
            "tax_documentation",
            "board_consent",
            "other"
          ],
          "title": "Document Type"
        },
        "file_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "File Name"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "grant_id",
        "document_type",
        "file_name"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: activate_grant
Description: Activates a grant if:
1. Status is 'approved' (implies CFO and Legal approved).
2. Signed grant agreement is uploaded.
3. Tax documentation is uploaded.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "grant_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Grant Id",
          "description": ""
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "grant_id"
      ]
    }
